 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Passkeys
+
+Sign-in, sign-up, and account settings (`/account`) support passkeys:
+
+- **Sign in** with a passkey from the username field's autofill or the "Sign in with a passkey" button.
+- **Sign up / password sign-in** offers to create a passkey afterwards (silently via conditional create where supported).
+- **Account settings** list, rename, create, and delete passkeys. Deleting a passkey requires a recent passkey reauthentication.
+
+Password sign-in and registration are proxied through `/api/auth/*` so the server can keep a session. Passkey
+ceremonies are verified server-side with [SimpleWebAuthn](https://simplewebauthn.dev/).
+
+| Variable | Purpose |
+| --- | --- |
+| `PASSKEY_RP_ID` | Relying Party ID (domain) passkeys are bound to. Defaults to the request hostname. |
+| `PASSKEY_ORIGINS` | Comma-separated origins accepted during verification. Defaults to the request host. |
+| `AUTH_DATA_DIR` | Directory for the JSON user/passkey store. Defaults to `.data/`. Use persistent storage in production. |
+
+WebAuthn requires a secure context: use `https://` or `http://localhost`.
